Subject: [PATCH] Runtime: the mouse wheel as two bindable buttons; the mouse buttons held

MOUSE_WHEEL_UP / MOUSE_WHEEL_DOWN in the keyboard and mouse layout: a notch is a short press (60 ms down, 45 ms up) of
what it is bound to, queued, so the game sees each one at 30-240 frames a second. takeMouseButtonPresses(10 / 11) gives
a game the notches for its own use; mouseButtonHeld(left / right / middle); injectMouseWheel for tests.

